// WIND GUN tornado follow-up: once the knockback finishes, the target is
// pinned in place and spun around its own center axis - not orbited around
// a distant point - while heavy periodic damage tears through it. If the
// enemy survives the spin-up, the tornado finishes it off outright. This
// makes a solid Wind Gun hit a near-guaranteed kill, not just crowd control.
