// ============================================================
// STEP 17.22 - COMBAT SYSTEM
// Shared combat rules for local and multiplayer gameplay.  The existing
// projectile/laser/rocket code remains responsible for collision detection;
// this layer centralizes the rules applied once a hit is confirmed so new
// weapons and network messages do not each invent their own damage semantics.
